  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5606.04 Unauthorized Use of Personal Information",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5606.04 Unauthorized Use of Personal Information.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 263:12, X, no person shall scan, record, retain, or store, in any electronic form or format, personal information obtained from any license, unless authorized by the department.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 263:12, anyone who knowingly violates (b) above shall be guilty of a misdemeanor. In addition, a person may be subject to penalties as set forth in RSA 260:14.\n\nSource. #7813, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-03",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
}
